# CODEOWNERS
#
# Controls which team members are required reviewers for changes to specific paths.
#
# Format: <path pattern>  <owner(s)>
#
# Owners must be real GitHub usernames or team slugs in the format:
#   @username
#   @SyncLabDev/team-slug
#
# Replace @SyncLabDev/maintainers with your actual username(s) or team slug.
# Example: * @your-github-username
#
# If you have not yet created teams in GitHub, use individual usernames:
#   * @username1 @username2
#
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DEFAULT — all files require maintainer review
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*                           @SyncLabDev/maintainers

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# GOVERNANCE — issue templates, PR template, contributing, security
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/    @SyncLabDev/maintainers
/.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md @SyncLabDev/maintainers
/CONTRIBUTING.md            @SyncLabDev/maintainers
/SECURITY.md                @SyncLabDev/maintainers
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md         @SyncLabDev/maintainers

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PROFILE
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/profile/                   @SyncLabDev/maintainers
